<title>CHINA: Lionda in Wuhan amusement park project.</title>
<headline>Lionda in Wuhan amusement park project.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shenzhen Lionda Holdings Co Ltd plans to take part in a $50 million amusement part project in the central China city of Wuhan, Wuhan mayor Wang Shouhai said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Lionda, which has A and B shares listed on the Shenzhen stock exchange, would join five other companies in undertaking the project, Wang told reporters.</p>
<p>Construction would start in May and would be completed in two years, he said.</p>
<p>He gave no details as to the size of Lionda's stake in the project.</p>
<p>Lionda has interests in a brewery as well as in industry and real estate development.</p>
</text>
